config BR2_PACKAGE_LUCKFOX_PICO_DRIVERS
	bool "luckfox-pico-drivers"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  Custom drivers and hardware support for Luckfox Pico boards
	  in RaspberryMatic, based on the official LuckfoxTECH SDK.
	  
	  This package provides:
	  - Camera/ISP drivers from LuckfoxTECH SDK (sysdrv/)
	  - Media libraries for video processing (media/)
	  - NPU drivers for AI workloads (RV1106)
	  - Custom GPIO, I2C, SPI configurations
	  - Board-specific hardware support
	  - HomeMatic integration scripts
	  
	  The drivers are extracted from the official SDK at:
	  https://github.com/LuckfoxTECH/luckfox-pico
	  
	  Note: This requires the LuckfoxTECH SDK to be available
	  during the build process.
